342e7397-c4f2-481a-8fe5-9e469e163a0e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なかなか厳しい問題だ","ts":"1624968881.267800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"za9k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d607964-3180-434b-8a71-c3389d580b2e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それでも例外を握り潰すより性能よかったりしそう","ts":"1624968817.267200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GHDt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4debd076-3bc9-4726-b7cc-a8acc3daa5c1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"代入で結局キー探索走るので","ts":"1624968795.267100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bEy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"daeeba6c-e46a-4678-8728-ae603f982b33","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"検索速度も負荷も大差ないでしょうしね","ts":"1624968771.267000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wf8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25a6fdc2-71ba-4350-9e46-b141b4609217","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"has_keyと変わらないですよね…","ts":"1624968757.266700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jQO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0988396-a575-4a70-a01a-0abda2ceef9f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"エラーさせない *だけ* なら\n```let dict['foo'] = ''\nunlet dict['foo']```\nというどーしようもない方法を思いついたが、ほんとうにしょうもない","ts":"1624968733.266600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"leuy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e98474ef-a761-4729-8f35-14f61ba1e169","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimはイテレータないから配列の配列が大量発生する問題もある","ts":"1624968695.265800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nstg2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9f9646b-50c2-44e4-a029-83eb0614325c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今は\n```if has_key(dict, 'foo')\n  call remove(dict, 'foo')\nendif```\nって書いてるけど、何箇所か書いて、ほんまか～? って気持ちになってきている","ts":"1624968622.265400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1xzL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"644de9e5-027a-4024-9929-926df1b3974a","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"`filter()` だと全てのキーについて走査することになりますしねえ…","ts":"1624968614.265100","edited":{"user":"U0230SSJ32B","ts":"1624968635.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ndIfd"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nremove({list}, {idx} [, {end}])                         *remove()*\n                {end}を指定しなかった場合: リスト |List| {list}から{idx}位置の\n                要素を削除し、その要素を返す。\n                {end}を指定した場合: {idx}から{end}まで(両端を含む)の要素を削\n                除し、それらの要素からなるリスト |List| を返す。{idx}と{end}が\n                同じ要素を指す場合、1個の要素からなるリストが返る。{end}が{idx}\n                より前になる場合、エラーとなる。\n                {idx}と{end}として指定できる値については|list-index|を参照。\n                例:  \n                        :echo \"last item: \" . remove(mylist, -1)\n                        :call remove(mylist, 0, 9)\n \n                ファイルを削除するには |delete()| を使う。\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        mylist-\u0026gt;remove(idx)\n \nremove({blob}, {idx} [, {end}])\n                {end}を指定しなかった場合: |Blob| {blob}から{idx}位置のバイト\n                を削除し、そのバイトを返す。\n                {end}を指定した場合: {idx}から{end}まで(両端を含む)のバイトを\n                削除し、それらのバイトを |Blob| で返す。{idx}と{end}が同じバイ\n                トを指す場合、1個のバイトからなる |Blob| が返る。\n                {end}が{idx}より前になる場合、エラーとなる。\n                例:  \n                        :echo \"last byte: \" . remove(myblob, -1)\n                        :call remove(mylist, 0, 9)\n \nremove({dict}, {key})\n                {dict}からキー{key}を持つ要素を削除し、それを返す。例:  \n                        :echo \"removed \" . remove(dict, \"one\")\n                {dict}に{key}がない場合はエラーになる。\n```","ts":"1624968530.263700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"649c51c9-6ee3-4332-8f68-4e917e75712f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":h remove()\nでもsilentが必要なのかわらずか","ts":"1624968529.263600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sWKH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f3534f0-0c45-445f-bd74-a177965ccada","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"所有権をフル活用してる","ts":"1624968394.262700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AaUg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"999c2063-4112-4831-9435-84bbc028aac6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Entry","ts":"1624968387.262600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nD19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"585efb8e-c010-43d1-b194-115236a5a197","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"方法あってもよさそうだけどなぁ","ts":"1624968385.262400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oMm6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e09cb7e9-e2a9-41dd-b4f1-7096edf1df2f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"このへんRustが上手いんだよな(スレチ","ts":"1624968382.262300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=CGW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3389b481-02b2-4cc4-809d-260d8d4bea2a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":hai-small:","ts":"1624968355.262000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gN+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27fcd584-93a1-45e7-8ed4-71ae3a5be9f2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"存在チェックしてから消すの、キーを 2 回探すことになるので処理的にも無駄だしコード的にも冗長になる","ts":"1624968351.261700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"typ